{"unit_id":"FurryBear2025__dsh-session-drag-move#card-zh","repo":"FurryBear2025/dsh-session-drag-move","commit":"c9cbb0cc49bb915fb40c59256da8843dad6f9b66","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-drag-move 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话管理插件，可在侧栏把会话拖到另一个工作区，以改变会话的实际归属。客户端在捕获阶段识别会话行和目标工作区，并通过宿主 API 发起迁移；宿主改写会话日志 header 中的 cwd、搬动日志目录并同步工作区账本。移动一个会话时还会尝试携带它的分支后代，界面显示迁移阶段和结果。适合需要整理项目工作区或调整会话归属的 DSH 用户。需要本地 DSH 会话存储，并由宿主提供 webServer 与 workspaceRegistry。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:791-815","lib/index.js:159-188","lib/session-log.js:414-458"]}
{"unit_id":"FurryBear2025__dsh-session-drag-move#card-en","repo":"FurryBear2025/dsh-session-drag-move","commit":"c9cbb0cc49bb915fb40c59256da8843dad6f9b66","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-drag-move lets DSH web users drag sessions between workspaces. The host rewrites log header cwd, moves its directory, updates ordering, and carries fork descendants when possible. The interface shows progress and errors. It needs the local session store, webServer, and workspaceRegistry.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:791-815","lib/index.js:159-188","lib/session-log.js:414-458"]}
